{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>כי אם זכרתני אתך etc. והזכרתני.</b> I heard from the mouth of my master my father, of blessed memory: כי אם זכרתני — you yourself shall remember me; והזכרתני — through an agent. And that is what is written at the end of the parashah: ולא זכר שר המשקים — he himself did not remember him; וישכחהו — even through an agent."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:46.585354659Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}